---
import PolicyLayout from '../../tutoring/layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
---
<PolicyLayout title="Privacy notice" lede="What information is collected, why, and how long it is kept.">
  <h2>Outline to complete</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Who is the data controller, and ICO data protection fee registration</li>
    <li>What is collected: parent and student contact details, booking and payment records, session notes</li>
    <li>Lawful basis for each type of data</li>
    <li>Special category information (only when needed for safe, accessible tuition)</li>
    <li>Processors: Cal.com, Stripe, video platform, email provider</li>
    <li>Retention periods and how to request access or deletion</li>
  </ul>
</PolicyLayout>
